",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"このヒントを共有"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"詳細を閉じる"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["短期の海外旅行保険であれば、数十から数百元程度です。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["海外での治療費は自己負担となります。中国国内の医療保険は海外では基本的に適用されません。領事保護においても、この費用の立て替えは行われません（第 3 条、領事保護ができること・できないことの根拠は、条例第26条を参照）。本当に家族を破綻させるのは、外来診療費ではなく、重傷後の入院費用と医療搬送費用です。海外の病院から自国へ患者を搬送する場合、専用機や医療搬送を利用する必要があり、これは自己負担項目の中でも最も高額な部類に入ります。米国疾病予防管理センター（CDC）の見解によれば、遠隔地から適切な病院へ患者を緊急搬送する場合、自己負担では 10 万ドル以上かかる可能性があります。保険加入時には、まず2つの補償限度額を優先的に確認してください。一つは「海外医療費用」の限度額。もう一つは「緊急医療送還・送還」の限度額です。これは、事故後の転院や、帰国させる際に最大いくらまで補償されるかを規定するものです。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["出典"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["国务院 (2023). 领事保护与协助条例（国令第 763 号）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202307/content_6891761.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202307/content_6891761.htm"]},"（第二十六条）；美国疾病控制与预防中心. Travelers' Health: Travel Insurance：「Medical evacuation insurance covers emergency transportation from a remote area to a high-quality hospital, which could otherwise cost more than $100,000.」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://wwwnc.cdc.gov/travel/page/insurance","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://wwwnc.cdc.gov/travel/page/insurance"]},"；其余为作者经验，无直接文献"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202307/content_6891761.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["出典を開く"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["著者の注記"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["「10 万ドル」という表現は下限を示すものであり、費用の範囲を示すものではありません。公的機関や業界による公開された費用範囲の統計は見当たらないため、本書では具体的な範囲については記載していません。購入前に3つの点を確認してください。第一に、渡航先の国が補償範囲に含まれているか。第二に、ダイビング、スキー、バイクなどの高リスク活動が免責事項（補償対象外）になっていないか。第三に、保険金支払いが保険会社から病院への直接支払いか、あるいは一度自身で立て替えてから後日請求する形式か。ビザ免除の国へ行く場合でも、同様に保険への加入が必要です。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["自分のメモ"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["自分へのメモを書く…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/ja/tip/21-03"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["前へ"]},"領事保護ができること・できないことを知っておく：面会は可能だが、身柄の救出は不可能。費用は自己負担です"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/ja/tip/21-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["次へ"]},"「海外の高額求人」はすべて詐欺とみなすべき。騙されて電信詐欺に従事すると、帰国後に出国禁止措置を受ける可能性も"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":